WEBVTT

00:02:01.159 --> 00:02:03.536
There's a need for urgent action.

00:02:04.078 --> 00:02:06.289
From at least three lenses.

00:02:07.123 --> 00:02:09.208
A health lens,

00:02:09.250 --> 00:02:12.628
an equity lens and a climate lens.

00:02:14.213 --> 00:02:16.507
Starting with the climate lens,

00:02:16.549 --> 00:02:20.094
we must modify how we grow food
and reduce food waste.

00:02:22.138 --> 00:02:26.225
Our food ecosystem is one of the largest
contributors to climate change.

00:02:26.934 --> 00:02:31.147
We keep cutting down trees
to grow more food,